-- Color.cm -- Gargoyle, the 1986 colour illustrator, on the colour display.-- Tim made his book's artwork in Gargoyle, so this is the tool, not a demo.Echo Turning the colour display on...ColorDisplay onEcho Fetching Gargoyle and the Install package.Bringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Gargoyle.dfBringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Install.DF-- Install FIRST. Gargoyle.load's first three lines are Install PopUpSelection-- / BiScrollersButtonned / SlackProcess, and all three were failing with-- [[Install not found]] -- so those packages were never loaded at all.-- InstallDoc: "Install is for loading packages. Given a package name, it-- executes the load file for the package, if that package is not already-- loaded." So VersionMismatch[BiScrollers] may well be a SYMPTOM of-- BiScrollersButtonned never having been installed, not a version clash.Echo Loading the Install command that Gargoyle.load needs...Run InstallImplEcho Loading Gargoyle, its packages, and the ColorTool...Source Gargoyle.loadEcho Now type  Gargoyle  to open it.